abstract: >-
  Experimental multi-agent reinforcement-learning research framework with independent
  role policies, optional language-model mentorship, executed-outcome attribution
  and bounded synthetic CPU evaluation. Current licensing is source-available
  non-commercial; open-source relicensing remains subject to rights clearance.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - multi-agent systems
  - reproducibility
  - agent reliability
  - optional model mentorship
